{"name":"City Brume","hex":"#e0e0dc","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"city","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A large settlement, bigger than a town; sometimes with a specific legal definition, depending on the place.","A settlement granted special status by royal charter or letters patent; traditionally, a settlement with a cathedral regardless of size."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/city"},{"term":"brume","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Mist, fog, vapour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/brume"}],"entries":[{"title":"City","blocks":[{"text":"A city is a human settlement of a substantial size. The term \"city\" has different meanings around the world and in some places the settlement can be very small. Even where the term is limited to larger settlements, there is no universally agreed definition of the lower numerical boundary for their size. In a more specific sense, a city can be defined as a permanent and densely populated place with administratively defined boundaries whose members work primarily on non-agricultural tasks. Cities generally have extensive systems for housing, transportation, sanitation, utilities, land use, production of goods, and communication. Their density facilitates interaction between people, government organizations, and businesses, sometimes benefiting different parties in the process, such as improving the efficiency of goods and service distribution."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Tokyo_Shibuya_Scramble_Crossing_2018-10-09.jpg/330px-Tokyo_Shibuya_Scramble_Crossing_2018-10-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/City"},{"title":"Brume","blocks":[{"text":"Brume is a surname. It is also an English and French word for mist. Notable people with the surname include:"},{"items":["Ese Brume, Nigerian athlete","Fred Aghogho Brume (1942–2011), Nigerian politician"]}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brume"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Lagos-centre-from-executive-lounge-Continental-hotel-2026-IMG_7970_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Lagos-centre-from-executive-lounge-Continental-hotel-2026-IMG_7970_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Lagos-centre-from-executive-lounge-Continental-hotel-2026-IMG_7970_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Lagos-centre-from-executive-lounge-Continental-hotel-2026-IMG_7970_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Lagos-centre-from-executive-lounge-Continental-hotel-2026-IMG_7970_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Lagos-centre-from-executive-lounge-Continental-hotel-2026-IMG_7970_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALagos-centre-from-executive-lounge-Continental-hotel-2026-IMG_7970_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Camille_Pissarro_-_Boulevard_Montmartre%2C_Spring_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/500px-Camille_Pissarro_-_Boulevard_Montmartre%2C_Spring_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Camille_Pissarro_-_Boulevard_Montmartre%2C_Spring_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/1280px-Camille_Pissarro_-_Boulevard_Montmartre%2C_Spring_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Camille_Pissarro_-_Boulevard_Montmartre%2C_Spring_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/500px-Camille_Pissarro_-_Boulevard_Montmartre%2C_Spring_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=pa